{"3911240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shawarma Hell", "steam_appid": 3911240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4992980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Shawarma Hell, you play as a teenage part-timer trying to make ends meet by working late shifts at a grimy shawarma joint tucked away in ║̴̟͈͑▌̷̝̥̌║̷̫̳̔̔▌̸̢̅͠║̴̳͉̿█̵̢̣͘│̴̮͊͌▌̸̖̩̈̂. At first, the job seems boring—greasy grills, weird customers, and endless orders. But as the nights drag on, something darker begins to sizzle beneath the surface.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customers act increasingly bizarre, and as horrifying events escalate, you're forced to uncover the sinister truth behind your workplace and the cursed block it stands on.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Serve, and survive as you balance minimum-wage duties with unraveling a chilling mystery. Every choice you make during your shift affects how the story unfolds—will you make it to payday, or become part of the menu?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE TO BE FAST!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.poster.avif?t=1785578021\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.webm?t=1785578021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.mp4?t=1785578021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive this hellish experience, you will need to work as fast as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;YOU BETTER NOT SLACK OFF!!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/8fcef7a80fca2c9a84ffdf0852c72501.avif?t=1785578021\" alt=\"Manager\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to meet the manager's daily revanue target or there will be consequences.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In Shawarma Hell, you play as a teenage part-timer trying to make ends meet by working late shifts at a grimy shawarma joint tucked away in ║̴̟͈͑▌̷̝̥̌║̷̫̳̔̔▌̸̢̅͠║̴̳͉̿█̵̢̣͘│̴̮͊͌▌̸̖̩̈̂. At first, the job seems boring—greasy grills, weird customers, and endless orders. But as the nights drag on, something darker begins to sizzle beneath the surface.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customers act increasingly bizarre, and as horrifying events escalate, you're forced to uncover the sinister truth behind your workplace and the cursed block it stands on.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Serve, and survive as you balance minimum-wage duties with unraveling a chilling mystery. Every choice you make during your shift affects how the story unfolds—will you make it to payday, or become part of the menu?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU HAVE TO BE FAST!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.poster.avif?t=1785578021\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.webm?t=1785578021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911240/extras/6273b033e3e93f619874a5700b4ab95a.mp4?t=1785578021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p